在描述中虚构不存在的人物。**\n    * **若画面是静物/产品**：聚焦于物体的材质光泽、纹理细节、颜色搭配及摆放形态。\n    * **若画面包含人物**：才需要描述人物的性别、服饰、发型及动作。**如果画面无人，请直接跳过此项，不要编造。**\n\n2.  **环境与光影**：\n    * 描述光源来源（自然光、人造灯光、丁达尔光束）、光影的明暗对比、色调氛围（庄重、神秘、明亮）。\n\n3.  **构图与视角**：\n    * 描述镜头语言（如对称构图、广角仰视、微距特写、景深虚化）。\n\n**输出要求**：\n* 输出一段连贯的中文自然语言，不要分点。\n* **若原图中没有人物，描述中绝不能出现“男人、女人、行人”等词汇。**\n* 字数控制在500字以内。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "link": 431, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 200, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 25}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [435, 457], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [406.6506042480469, 593.3935546875], "pos": [-2866.268798828125, -2440.358642578125], "widgets_values": ["beba54a9be1fbf21ceb83c8c1ce3f18f504e6cce5fa3dbd9711811ccb57795ca.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 207, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [429], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [318.8943176269531, 147.64974975585938], "pos": [-2477.526123046875, -1348.3165283203125], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 424, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localize